sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant AD as Admin (token user)
    participant G as Gateway
    participant PE as Policy Engine
    participant DB as MySQL (audit_logs)

    Note over G,DB: Semua request sebelumnya menulis 1 baris audit<br/>(allow maupun deny) lewat INSERT zt_gateway

    AD->>G: GET /audit?limit=50&decision=deny<br/>Bearer + X-Device-ID
    G->>PE: authorize('audit.list')
    alt role bukan admin (mahasiswa/dosen)
        PE-->>G: deny ROLE_NOT_ALLOWED
        G->>DB: INSERT audit (deny)
        G-->>AD: 403 ROLE_NOT_ALLOWED
    else token service
        PE-->>G: deny SERVICE_TOKEN_ON_USER_ENDPOINT
        G->>DB: INSERT audit (deny)
        G-->>AD: 403 SERVICE_TOKEN_ON_USER_ENDPOINT
    else admin
        PE-->>G: allow ADMIN_AUDIT_READ
        G->>DB: INSERT audit (allow) — baris request ini sendiri
        G->>G: validasi zod query (limit 1-200,<br/>decision enum, subject_id)
        Note over G: error validasi ⇒ 400 VALIDATION_ERROR,<br/>baris audit tetap allow (PE sudah memutuskan)
        G->>DB: SELECT ... ORDER BY id DESC LIMIT ?<br/>(grant SELECT khusus zt_gateway, tanpa UPDATE/DELETE)
        G-->>AD: 200 data.items (terbaru pertama,<br/>termasuk baris /audit di posisi pertama)
    end
